ent;"></div></figure>
<hr>
<p>The next point is an end point, which means an active interval has just =
finished. So, let=E2=80=99s decrement our counter. Now, the number of activ=
e intervals is 1, which also corresponds with the current number of overlap=
ping intervals:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: left;"=
><img alt=3D"Image represents a diagram illustrating a coding pattern, like=
