ks a specific event or point of interest.  A square labeled 'i' above the n=
umber line points downwards with an arrow to this circle, suggesting an inp=
ut or trigger at this point.  Three distinct intervals are shown: one start=
ing at approximately 1 and ending at 3 (peach circle), another starting at =
